{% comment %}
  AI Glasses Try-On — site-wide embed.

  The product-page block (tryon-button.liquid) only runs where a merchant
  manually placed it — the product template. That's fine for the single
  "Try on" button on a product page, but the mini-card button (this app's
  Settings → "Mini-card button" tab) needs to run on collection/search
  pages too, where that block was never added. This embed is what makes
  that possible: once enabled (Theme editor → App embeds → "AI Glasses
  Try-On"), Shopify loads tryon-widget.js on every storefront page, so
  @lumiframe/sdk's own card detector (detectCards()) can find product
  cards on any listing page, not just wherever the product block sits.

  tryon-widget.js guards against running twice (window.__lumiTryOnBooted)
  so it's safe to have both this embed AND the product-page block active
  on the same product page at once.
{% endcomment %}
<div data-agto-embed style="display:none" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}></div>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "AI Glasses Try-On",
  "target": "body",
  "javascript": "tryon-widget.js"
}
{% endschema %}
